  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Lumenwrought)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You put on a story, and the world agrees.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Sovereign Mask (1/a Soma Break).</strong> Over 1 minute, assume a mythic persona (King, Trickster, Saint, Monster, etc.). For 10 minutes, you gain a skill rank in Diplomacy (Presence), Stealth (Intrigue) (Intrigue) (Presence), and Intimidation (Presence) (Presence) (or mastery if already proficient), and you can’t be magically compelled to speak against your will.</p>",
